The Plaintiff prayed for the following reliefs in the original Plaint:
"(i) Pass a Decree of declaration in favour of the plaintiffs and against the Defendants, thereby declaring that the documents namely Power of Attorney,
affidavit, possession letter etc. all dated 27.01.2006 being obtained by fraud and are null, void and non-est in law and consequently be cancelled: and/or;

305 . The Ld. Counsel for the defendants no. 1 to 3 has gone on to cite another judgement of the Apex Court of India, which states as follows;
Chattar Singh Saini vs Parmeshwari Devi And Ors on 29 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/121643592/
